# 31. Important legal safeguards for MANAK

## SAFEGUARD-01

Do not call a product legally "compliant" solely because its Amazon/Flipkart listing passes.

Use:

> **Online Listing Appears Compliant**

instead.

---

## SAFEGUARD-02

Do not call a product legally "non-compliant" solely because physical-package information is unavailable online when the e-commerce rule does not require that information online.

---

## SAFEGUARD-03

Manufacturing/packing month/year:

```text
Physical package → applicable where required
E-commerce listing → NOT required under the DCA e-commerce FAQ exception
```

---

## SAFEGUARD-04

Do not automatically treat an image's missing information as a legal violation if the information may appear elsewhere on the marketplace page.

Search:

```text
Title
Bullet points
Description
Specifications
Seller information
Legal metrology section
Product images
Manufacturer information
Additional information
```

---

## SAFEGUARD-05

Do not infer actual physical quantity from an image.

```text
Listing says 1 kg
≠
MANAK verified actual 1 kg
```

The latter requires physical measurement.

---

## SAFEGUARD-06

Do not infer registration solely from manufacturer name.

Registration requires external verification.

