## 36. Implementation principle

> **MANAK is an online compliance screening engine, not a replacement for physical Legal Metrology inspection.**

The strongest architecture is:

```text
                 MANAK
                   |
       +-----------+-----------+
       |           |           |
   ONLINE       IMAGE       EXTERNAL
   CHECK       SCREENING    VERIFICATION
       |           |           |
 Amazon/Flipkart  OCR/CV    Govt records
       |           |           |
       +-----------+-----------+
                   |
             RULE ENGINE
                   |
        +----------+----------+
        |                     |
 ONLINE RESULT        VERIFICATION RESULT
        |                     |
 PASS/FAIL/PARTIAL     PHYSICAL/EXTERNAL
```

